@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@shopifyHmac = REPLACE_WITH_VALID_HMAC

# Nota:
# - El servidor espera body raw (application/json) para calcular HMAC.
# - Reemplaza @shopifyHmac con el HMAC real generado con WEBHOOK_SECRET.

### Webhook: product update
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/products/update
Content-Type: application/json
X-Shopify-Topic: products/update
X-Shopify-Shop-Domain: your-shop.myshopify.com
X-Shopify-Hmac-Sha256: {{shopifyHmac}}

{
	"id": 15664461250885,
	"title": "Globo Gigante Osito Crema",
	"updated_at": "2026-02-14T12:00:00Z"
}

### Webhook: order create
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/orders/create
Content-Type: application/json
X-Shopify-Topic: orders/create
X-Shopify-Shop-Domain: your-shop.myshopify.com
X-Shopify-Hmac-Sha256: {{shopifyHmac}}

{
	"id": 1234567890,
	"created_at": "2026-02-14T12:05:00Z",
	"line_items": [
		{
			"id": 111,
			"product_id": 8603859452229,
			"variant_id": 444,
			"quantity": 1,
			"title": "Bundle de prueba"
		}
	]
}
